<div class="soc-case-header">INC-2024-0955</div>
<div class="soc-case-id">Credential Harvesting Phishing Campaign</div>
<div class="soc-case-narrative">
  At 09:14 UTC, a Marketing employee reported a suspicious email claiming to be from the IT Security Team demanding an immediate password reset. The email bypassed the Proofpoint gateway and landed in at least 12 inboxes across three departments.
  <br><br>
  Analyze the phishing infrastructure, decode the obfuscated payload, identify which users were compromised, and trace the attacker's post-compromise activity.
</div>

<div class="soc-case-goal">
  <div class="soc-case-goal-label">Objective 1</div>
  <div class="soc-case-goal-text">Identify the phishing domain and sending infrastructure</div>
</div>
<div class="soc-case-goal">
  <div class="soc-case-goal-label">Objective 2</div>
  <div class="soc-case-goal-text">Find compromised accounts that clicked the malicious link</div>
</div>
<div class="soc-case-goal">
  <div class="soc-case-goal-label">Objective 3</div>
  <div class="soc-case-goal-text">Trace attacker lateral movement using stolen credentials</div>
</div>

